                # So no lower bound. Instead we check that if there is such a pair,
                # the answer is at least 1 (since either i or j could be honest alone).
                # But a single person can always be honest. So answer >=1 is always true.
                # This test is weak, but it's okay.
                assert int(run(x).strip()) >= 1
                return

